{"id":50849,"date":"2021-09-17T15:41:29","date_gmt":"2021-09-17T21:41:29","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/?page_id=50849"},"modified":"2025-04-09T02:09:46","modified_gmt":"2025-04-09T08:09:46","slug":"our-story","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/our-story\/","title":{"rendered":"Our Story"},"content":{"rendered":"\n\t<div class=\"img has-hover hidden x md-x lg-x y md-y lg-y\" id=\"image_990809164\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-inner dark\" >\n\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"929\" src=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/Kiierr-we-love-our-customers-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-original size-original\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/Kiierr-we-love-our-customers-scaled-1.jpg 2560w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/Kiierr-we-love-our-customers-scaled-1-800x290.jpg 800w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/Kiierr-we-love-our-customers-scaled-1-300x109.jpg 300w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/Kiierr-we-love-our-customers-scaled-1-1024x372.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/Kiierr-we-love-our-customers-scaled-1-768x279.jpg 768w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/Kiierr-we-love-our-customers-scaled-1-1536x557.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/Kiierr-we-love-our-customers-scaled-1-2048x743.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/Kiierr-we-love-our-customers-scaled-1-1080x392.jpg 1080w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/Kiierr-we-love-our-customers-scaled-1-1280x465.jpg 1280w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/Kiierr-we-love-our-customers-scaled-1-980x356.jpg 980w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/Kiierr-we-love-our-customers-scaled-1-480x174.jpg 480w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/Kiierr-we-love-our-customers-scaled-1-24x9.jpg 24w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/Kiierr-we-love-our-customers-scaled-1-36x13.jpg 36w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/Kiierr-we-love-our-customers-scaled-1-48x17.jpg 48w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<style>\n#image_990809164 {\n  width: 100%;\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\n\n\t<section class=\"section\" id=\"section_350710478\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section-bg fill\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<div class=\"section-content relative\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-1512441513\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1024621092\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner text-center\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-1198185689\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<h1>From Husband\u2019s Love to Life-Changing Innovation: The Story Behind Kiierr\u2019s Mission to Solve Hair Loss<\/h1>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-1198185689 {\n  font-size: 1.45rem;\n  text-align: center;\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-1198185689 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"img has-hover x md-x lg-x y md-y lg-y\" id=\"image_995332531\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-inner dark\" >\n\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"763\" src=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/a-e1725126198717-1024x763-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-original size-original\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/a-e1725126198717-1024x763-1.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/a-e1725126198717-1024x763-1-300x224.jpg 300w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/a-e1725126198717-1024x763-1-768x572.jpg 768w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/a-e1725126198717-1024x763-1-800x596.jpg 800w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<style>\n#image_995332531 {\n  width: 100%;\n}\n@media (min-width:550px) {\n  #image_995332531 {\n    width: 59%;\n  }\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t<div id=\"text-2246366687\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p>Michael and Jolene Anderson before Jolene&#8217;s hair loss began.<\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-2246366687 {\n  text-align: center;\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-2246366687 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-1843081105\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1833683096\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-841930416\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<h2>A Husband\u2019s Unwavering Support: Jolene\u2019s Hair Loss Journey<\/h2>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-841930416 {\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  text-align: left;\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-841930416 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t<div id=\"text-2518338346\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p>When Jolene first noticed her hair thinning after the birth of their child, it was more than just a cosmetic concern\u2014it was an emotional blow that affected her self-esteem and happiness. Mike, her devoted husband, watched as the joy of new motherhood was overshadowed by her growing anxiety over hair loss. For Jolene, each strand lost was a painful reminder of something she couldn\u2019t control, and it began to take a toll on her confidence.<\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-2518338346 {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-2518338346 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-955908838\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-464642690\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner text-center\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"img has-hover x md-x lg-x y md-y lg-y\" id=\"image_1933192179\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-inner dark\" >\n\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"628\" src=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/6-1024x628-1.png\" class=\"attachment-original size-original\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/6-1024x628-1.png 1024w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/6-1024x628-1-300x184.png 300w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/6-1024x628-1-768x471.png 768w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/6-1024x628-1-800x491.png 800w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<style>\n#image_1933192179 {\n  width: 100%;\n}\n@media (min-width:550px) {\n  #image_1933192179 {\n    width: 59%;\n  }\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t<div id=\"text-2809989033\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p>A close-up of Jolene, showing the initial stages of her hair loss journey<\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-2809989033 {\n  text-align: center;\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-2809989033 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-1308876508\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-744623586\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-829729288\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<h3>Identifying the Problem: Why Common Hair Loss Solutions Weren\u2019t Enough<\/h3>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-829729288 {\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-829729288 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t<div id=\"text-3218885762\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p>Determined not to let his wife suffer in silence, Mike dove into researching every possible solution. As he evaluated existing hair loss treatments, Mike identified several key issues with the more common options:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Altering Hormones:<\/strong>\u00a0Many treatments, such as Propecia, interfere with hormonal balance, which was not ideal for Jolene, especially during breastfeeding.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Introducing Chemicals:<\/strong>\u00a0Options like Rogaine and Finasteride introduce chemicals into the bloodstream, raising concerns about potential side effects and long-term health impacts.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Risk to Newborn:<\/strong>\u00a0Given that Jolene was breastfeeding, Mike was particularly cautious about any solution that could inadvertently affect their newborn child through Jolene\u2019s milk.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-3218885762 {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-3218885762 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t<div id=\"text-3707298950\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<h3>A Natural Solution: Discovering Low-Level Light Therapy (LLLT)<br \/>\n<\/h3>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-3707298950 {\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-3707298950 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t<div id=\"text-3335659741\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-62e48ff elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"62e48ff\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p>Believing strongly in natural health solutions and concerned about these risks, Mike sought out a treatment that would be both safe and effective. This search led him to\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/\">low-level light therapy (LLLT) to regrow thinning hair<\/a>, a natural solution that uses the body\u2019s own healing power to revitalize hair follicles without introducing harmful substances. Mike saw an opportunity not just to help Jolene, but to create something that could potentially change the lives of millions who were experiencing the same issue.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6cc0410 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"6cc0410\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-3335659741 {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-3335659741 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-1852475425\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-225588997\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner text-center\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"img has-hover x md-x lg-x y md-y lg-y\" id=\"image_334014684\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-inner dark\" >\n\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"628\" src=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/5-1024x628-1.png\" class=\"attachment-original size-original\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/5-1024x628-1.png 1024w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/5-1024x628-1-300x184.png 300w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/5-1024x628-1-768x471.png 768w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/5-1024x628-1-800x491.png 800w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<style>\n#image_334014684 {\n  width: 100%;\n}\n@media (min-width:550px) {\n  #image_334014684 {\n    width: 59%;\n  }\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t<div id=\"text-2946065589\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p>Kiierr MD Laser Cap &#8211; FDA-Cleared For Hair Growth in Men &#038; Women<\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-2946065589 {\n  text-align: center;\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-2946065589 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-1822689380\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-250435692\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-1538200366\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<h3><span id=\"The_Sacrifices_Behind_Kiierrs_Success\"><b>The Sacrifices Behind Kiierr\u2019s Success<\/b><\/span><\/h3>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-1538200366 {\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-1538200366 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t<div id=\"text-1758260541\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5f9e6fc elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5f9e6fc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p>To bring their vision to life, Mike and Jolene sold their home, moved in with family, and used their life savings to fund the development and\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/product\/kiierr-laser-hair-growth-products\/?attribute_pa_choose-cap=272-premiere\">FDA clearance of the Kiierr laser cap<\/a>. This enormous risk showed their deep commitment to creating a safe and effective product for hair restoration.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8216a25 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8216a25\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-1758260541 {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-1758260541 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t<div id=\"text-2711565020\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<h3><span id=\"From_Vision_to_Reality_The_Birth_of_Kiierr\"><strong>From Vision to Reality: The Birth of Kiierr<\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-2711565020 {\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-2711565020 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t<div id=\"text-4191826056\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p>The couple\u2019s journey was not without challenges. Mike and Jolene invested their savings, time, and energy into developing a product that would meet the highest standards of safety and efficacy. There were countless late nights, testing different prototypes, consulting with medical professionals, and facing the uncertainty of whether their efforts would bear fruit. But through it all, Mike was driven by a singular goal: to restore not just Jolene\u2019s hair, but her sense of self-worth.<\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-4191826056 {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-4191826056 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-1730249958\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-279726034\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner text-center\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"img has-hover x md-x lg-x y md-y lg-y\" id=\"image_1103189607\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-inner dark\" >\n\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"628\" src=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/8-1024x628-1.png\" class=\"attachment-original size-original\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/8-1024x628-1.png 1024w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/8-1024x628-1-300x184.png 300w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/8-1024x628-1-768x471.png 768w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/8-1024x628-1-800x491.png 800w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<style>\n#image_1103189607 {\n  width: 100%;\n}\n@media (min-width:550px) {\n  #image_1103189607 {\n    width: 59%;\n  }\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t<div id=\"text-2780104941\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p>Jolene\u2019s &#8220;after&#8221; photo, showcasing her impressive hair regrowth after using the Kiierr laser cap.<\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-2780104941 {\n  text-align: center;\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-2780104941 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-128564223\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-980188141\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-689433222\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<h3><span id=\"A_Miraculous_Transformation_Jolenes_Success_with_Kiierr\"><strong>A Miraculous Transformation: Jolene\u2019s Success with Kiierr\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-689433222 {\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-689433222 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t<div id=\"text-2125662394\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p>After many months of hard work, the first <a href=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/product\/kiierr-laser-hair-growth-products\/\">Kiierr laser cap<\/a> was born\u2014a product that combined cutting-edge technology with ease of use, making it accessible to anyone suffering from hair loss. Jolene was the first to try it, and the results were nothing short of miraculous. As her hair began to regrow, so did her confidence, and the joy that had dimmed after her postpartum experience started to return.<\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-2125662394 {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-2125662394 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n<div class=\"video video-fit mb\" style=\"padding-top:56.25%;\"><p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Kiierr Founder Shares Emotional Story Of Helping His Wife Overcome Hair Loss\" src=\"https:\/\/player.vimeo.com\/video\/1014994955?dnt=1&amp;app_id=122963\" width=\"563\" height=\"1000\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture; clipboard-write; encrypted-media\"><\/iframe><\/p>\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-1979034999\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-23573689\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-1975492969\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<h3><span id=\"A_Husbands_Determination_Mikes_Journey_to_Create_Kiierr\"><strong>A Husband\u2019s Determination: Mike\u2019s Journey to Create Kiierr\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-1975492969 {\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-1975492969 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t<div id=\"text-2157565756\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p>Throughout Jolene\u2019s hair loss journey, her husband Mike was by her side, determined to find a solution. In his own words, Mike describes the emotional toll of seeing Jolene struggle and how he was inspired to stop at nothing to restore her confidence. Watch the video below as Mike shares his perspective and the story behind founding Kiierr, a product that has since helped thousands of people regain their hair and confidence.<\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-2157565756 {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-2157565756 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-628287480\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1647968540\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner text-center\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"img has-hover x md-x lg-x y md-y lg-y\" id=\"image_1369116962\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-inner dark\" >\n\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"628\" src=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/2-3-1024x628-1.png\" class=\"attachment-original size-original\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/2-3-1024x628-1.png 1024w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/2-3-1024x628-1-300x184.png 300w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/2-3-1024x628-1-768x471.png 768w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/2-3-1024x628-1-800x491.png 800w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<style>\n#image_1369116962 {\n  width: 100%;\n}\n@media (min-width:550px) {\n  #image_1369116962 {\n    width: 59%;\n  }\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t<div id=\"text-2520954065\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p>Kiierr Laser Cap: a one-time purchase for lifelong use, unlike pills and creams that require monthly repurchasing.<\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-2520954065 {\n  text-align: center;\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-2520954065 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-1859674760\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1079820285\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-1873875567\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<h3><span id=\"Buy_Once_Treat_Forever_The_Lifetime_Value_of_Kiierrs_Laser_Cap\"><b>Buy Once, Treat Forever: The Lifetime Value of Kiierr\u2019s Laser Cap<\/b><\/span><\/h3>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-1873875567 {\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-1873875567 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t<div id=\"text-349932063\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p>When you invest in <a href=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/product\/kiierr-laser-hair-growth-products\/\">Kiierr\u2019s laser cap<\/a>, you\u2019re purchasing a lifelong solution to hair loss. This is a one-time buy\u2014no need for monthly refills or repeat purchases. Unlike pills or creams that require continuous, costly reordering, the laser cap can be used for a lifetime and even shared with your spouse. When you factor in the cost of years of treatments and the potential for price increases, a single laser cap becomes the far more practical and affordable solution.<\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-349932063 {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-349932063 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-1216956720\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1095208646\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner text-center\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n<a href=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/\" class=\"button primary lowercase\"  >\n\t\t<span>Shop Kiierr Laser Caps Today \u2192<\/span>\n\t<\/a>\n\n\t<div class=\"img has-hover x md-x lg-x y md-y lg-y\" id=\"image_1183195980\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-inner dark\" >\n\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"628\" src=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/2-2-1024x628-1.png\" class=\"attachment-original size-original\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/2-2-1024x628-1.png 1024w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/2-2-1024x628-1-300x184.png 300w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/2-2-1024x628-1-768x471.png 768w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/2-2-1024x628-1-800x491.png 800w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<style>\n#image_1183195980 {\n  width: 100%;\n}\n@media (min-width:550px) {\n  #image_1183195980 {\n    width: 59%;\n  }\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t<div id=\"text-124751906\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p>Kiierr success stories, showing before &#038; after photos of real Kiierr customers.<\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-124751906 {\n  text-align: center;\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-124751906 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-1093733410\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1788240936\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-1443935367\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<h3><span id=\"Sharing_the_Success_Helping_Thousands_Reclaim_Their_Confidence\"><strong>Sharing the Success: Helping Thousands Reclaim Their Confidence<\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-1443935367 {\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-1443935367 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t<div id=\"text-3214561686\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p>Seeing the impact the product had on Jolene, Mike knew he couldn\u2019t keep it to themselves. They decided to launch Kiierr, a company dedicated to helping others reclaim their hair and, more importantly, their confidence. What started as a labor of love quickly grew into a thriving business, thanks in large part to the couple\u2019s authentic story and genuine desire to make a difference.<\/p>\n<p>Today, <strong>Kiierr has helped over 100,000 people<\/strong> around the world combat hair loss. Each testimonial, each success story, is a testament to the power of love and determination. Mike and Jolene\u2019s journey from a personal struggle to a global solution is a reminder that sometimes, the most profound innovations come from a place of deep care and connection.<\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-3214561686 {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-3214561686 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-205149562\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-246241055\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner text-center\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n<a href=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/\" class=\"button primary lowercase\"  >\n\t\t<span>Shop Kiierr Laser Caps Today \u2192<\/span>\n\t<\/a>\n\n\t<div class=\"img has-hover x md-x lg-x y md-y lg-y\" id=\"image_46020583\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-inner dark\" >\n\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" src=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/asd-1024x576-1.png\" class=\"attachment-original size-original\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/asd-1024x576-1.png 1024w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/asd-1024x576-1-300x169.png 300w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/asd-1024x576-1-768x432.png 768w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/asd-1024x576-1-800x450.png 800w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<style>\n#image_46020583 {\n  width: 100%;\n}\n@media (min-width:550px) {\n  #image_46020583 {\n    width: 59%;\n  }\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t<div id=\"text-3731472746\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<h3><span id=\"Testimonials_Real_Stories_Real_Results\"><strong>Testimonials: Real Stories, Real Results<\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-3731472746 {\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  text-align: center;\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-3731472746 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t<div id=\"text-1701123982\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p><strong><em>\u201cI was skeptical at first, but after trying the Kiierr laser cap, my hair is fuller, and I feel so much better about myself. This product is a game-changer!\u201d<\/em>\u00a0\u2014 Mark R.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u201cKiierr changed my life! After just a few months, I started seeing new growth, and my confidence skyrocketed. I can\u2019t thank Mike and Jolene enough for their dedication to this product.\u201d<\/em>\u00a0\u2014 Tim G..<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u201cPostpartum hair loss was devastating for me, but Kiierr gave me hope. My hair is finally growing back, and I feel like myself again. Thank you, Kiierr!\u201d<\/em>\u00a0\u2014 Emily L.<\/strong><\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-1701123982 {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-1701123982 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-926812871\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-2122414623\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-2706763920\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<h3><span id=\"Join_the_Journey_Take_the_First_Step_Towards_Hair_Restoration\"><strong>Join the Journey: Take the First Step Towards Hair Restoration<\/strong><strong>\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-2706763920 {\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-2706763920 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t<div id=\"text-762533472\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p>Kiierr\u2019s mission continues to be inspired by the same love that sparked its creation. As the company grows, Mike and Jolene remain committed to helping others feel confident and beautiful, just as Jolene did when she saw the first signs of regrowth. Their story is proof that when you combine passion with perseverance, you can create something truly life-changing.<\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-762533472 {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-762533472 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-214771035\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-888640971\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner text-center\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n<a href=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/\" class=\"button primary lowercase\"  >\n\t\t<span>Shop Kiierr Laser Caps Today \u2192<\/span>\n\t<\/a>\n\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1478084822\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner text-center\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n<a href=\"tel:801-834-4970\" class=\"button primary is-large lowercase\"  style=\"padding:10px 30px 10px 30px;\">\n\t<i class=\"icon-phone\" aria-hidden=\"true\" ><\/i>\t<span>Call Us Now<\/span>\n\t<\/a>\n\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\n<style>\n#section_350710478 {\n  padding-top: 30px;\n  padding-bottom: 30px;\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/section>\n\t\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"page-blank.php","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-50849","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v24.9 (Yoast SEO v24.9) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Our Story - Kiierr L